-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Account 392 is charged to clearing accounts and then cleared to O&amp;amp;M expense accounts, clearing accounts, construction work and cost to retire on the basis of time each month.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;All other accounts are allocated on same basis of as Common Plant.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Property Leases are excluded from common plant total above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:27pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;2025 Electric 42%, Gas 20%, Water 38%.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-top:8pt;padding-left:3.24pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:7pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Federal Power Commission letter dated 1/19/71.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:CommonUtilityPlantAndExpensesDescriptionTextBlock>
